# TeraDesk regression (#Z C:\Apps\TERADESK\DESKTOP.NAP; geometry from
# measurement-2026-10-06-ldg-m3/screendumps/m3-on-teradesk-t35.png): a single
# click on TRASH (36,125) selects it; a double click on the first HARD DISC
# (195,38) opens its window (TeraDesk waits with 0x102/3/0).
# Ticks hz_200 after TeraDesk's first poll.
100 parkbr
1600 mark T00_DESK
1700 move 36 125
1900 down
1903 up
2400 mark T01_TRASH_SELECTED
2500 move 195 38
2700 down
2703 up
2708 down
2711 up
4200 mark T02_DRIVE_OPEN
4400 parkbr
4800 mark END
